great. I personally love Dance Trance, but would like to try out some of their partner dancing sessions and Hip Hop. They offer space for private events, and have a wonderful cafe. Some of the floors can be a bit slippery, but I'm guessing this will change over time. Great Space!"},{"business_id":"8OQlfitfdze2DAONRfd_yA","review_id":"Lxn2iBv5AO4DWX6vGAjCeA","date":"2016-04-11T18:01:41","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9262915849685669,"text_excerpt":"This is such a great rentable space with lots of light and big windows and mirrors. Most people rent this spot to practice dancing, but I recently had a photo shoot here it was the perfect area to convert into a quick studio. They let you rent the rooms by the hour and I love the open area of the room, the abundance of natural light and all of the space we had to work with. The staff here has always been nothing but kind to me whenever I have found myself here. There is a small kitchen space downstairs with a few snacks and coffee, if you plan on being here for a while."},{"business_id":"8OQlfitfdze2DAONRfd_yA","review_id":"aQJRcaywi5-oWXbYLzliYw","date":"2017-01-12T16:14:44","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9220157861709595,"text_excerpt":"I came to dance, dance, dance, dance I hit the floor cause that's my plans, plans, plans, plans... This place is pretty awesome. I initially came for their Christmas party and had such a great time I decided to take a dance class. I have no dance experience other than my club days... They offer quite a few different classes during the week, all at reasonable prices. Call them or go online for the current classes, as they change throughout the year. I believe there are four different studio rooms, each of a different size. All are clean and well maintained. But what I like the most is that the owners are really friendly as are the people that take classes. Apparently there is a dance commu..."}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
